Theorem 3.2 bridge for `n = 2m + 1`.
-/
theorem theorem32BackwardLowBisectionLevels_isEndpointLevelVector_of_feasible_gap_auto_first
    {n innerSteps : ℕ} (hn : 1 < n) (tFirst target lastLow : ℝ)
