exactly on the refined penultimate optimum or stays strictly above it.
-/
theorem theorem32_calculated_grid_levelTarget_eq_lastLow_or_lt_lastLow_of_source_outer_return
    {m outerSteps : ℕ} (hm : 0 < m)
